  "description": "<p data-end=\"372\" data-start=\"49\"><strong data-end=\"75\" data-start=\"49\">🔹 Brand Introduction:</strong><br data-end=\"78\" data-start=\"75\">Markery is a global online store offering high-quality trending products at competitive prices. We focus on customer satisfaction by providing free worldwide shipping and excellent service. Our goal is to make online shopping easy, accessible, and rewarding for both customers and affiliates.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"614\" data-start=\"374\"><strong data-end=\"401\" data-start=\"374\">🔹 Product Description:</strong><br data-end=\"404\" data-start=\"401\">We offer a wide range of products, including beauty, fashion, home essentials, and gadgets. Our carefully selected items are designed to provide great value while ensuring top-notch quality for our customers.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"652\" data-start=\"616\"><strong data-end=\"650\" data-start=\"616\">🔹 USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"868\" data-start=\"653\">\r\n<li data-end=\"699\" data-start=\"653\">Free worldwide shipping, including Canada.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"750\" data-start=\"700\">High-demand products with competitive pricing.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"802\" data-start=\"751\">Reliable product sourcing with quality control.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"868\" data-start=\"803\">Lucrative affiliate program with attractive commission rates.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-end=\"893\" data-start=\"870\"><strong data-end=\"891\" data-start=\"870\">🔹 Payment Terms:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1176\" data-start=\"894\">\r\n<li data-end=\"958\" data-start=\"894\">Affiliates earn <strong data-end=\"930\" data-start=\"912\">10% commission</strong> on every successful sale.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1058\" data-start=\"959\">Commissions are calculated from the <strong data-end=\"1018\" data-start=\"997\">total order value</strong> (excluding refunds or cancellations).</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1176\" data-start=\"1059\">Payments are made via <strong data-end=\"1110\" data-start=\"1083\">PayPal or bank transfer</strong> on a monthly basis, with a minimum payout threshold of <strong data-end=\"1173\" data-start=\"1166\">$20</strong>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-end=\"1205\" data-start=\"1178\"><strong data-end=\"1203\" data-start=\"1178\">🔹 Other Information:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1553\" data-start=\"1206\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1336\" data-start=\"1206\">Affiliates can access marketing materials such as banners, product images, and special discount codes to maximize conversions.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1436\" data-start=\"1337\">We provide <strong data-end=\"1372\" data-start=\"1350\">real-time tracking</strong> via the UpPromote dashboard to monitor sales and commissions.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1553\" data-start=\"1437\">We encourage affiliates to promote via social media, blogs, YouTube, and paid ads (excluding trademark bidding).</li>\r\n</ul>",
